# See fixtures/123_emit_upsert.ds.
#
#   pump 1  `copy` emits Out(1, 1) for Reading src 1
#   pump 2  `copy` fires for Reading src 2 and its emit replaces Out(1, 1):
#           assert(Out), then retract(Out), then the emit marker
#           (RFCS.6a.4)
#
# The trace compares the order in both runtimes; the recording checkers
# compare the FactEmit / FactWithdraw pair, and Mercury's reading of libds's
# recording meets them in the order it re-derives them.
assert Reading src=1 v=1
pump
assert Reading src=2 v=2
pump
